message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file,
  together with the power traces it analyses (listed under references). The
  accompanying paper is under review; its citation will be added here once it
  is published.
title: >-
  Firmware and analysis code for "Practical Key Recovery on the Shadow
  Lightweight Block Cipher with Non-Profiling Correlation Power Analysis"
